@page "/patterns"
@page "/patterns/{*rest}"
@inject NavigationManager Nav

@* The old "Patterns" catalog page was removed (owner decision — the header is now
   Docs / Components / Blocks; everything the page showed now lives on the component
   pages and the live catalog showcases). Cloudflare's _redirects handles the plain
   HTTP case (a 301 to /components before the SPA even loads), but a stale bookmark
   or in-app link can still land here via client-side navigation, which _redirects
   never sees. This stub catches that case and forwards to the catalog.
   Excluded from the sitemap / prerender route lists — it's not real content. *@

@code {
    // Matches the catch-all "{*rest}" route segment above — Blazor requires a
    // component parameter for every route parameter, catch-alls included, even
    // though its value is never read (both @page routes redirect the same way).
    [Parameter] public string? Rest { get; set; }

    protected override void OnInitialized() => Nav.NavigateTo("components", replace: true);
}
